{"Title":"An Act expanding the treatment of cleft palate and cleft lip","BillNumber":"H4825","DocketNumber":"HD5174","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"S_G2","Name":"Steven Ultrino","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/S_G2","ResponseDate":"2024-06-04T13:52:20.69"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"S_G2","Name":"Steven Ultrino","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/S_G2","ResponseDate":"2024-06-04T13:52:20.69"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4825/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Ultrino of Malden, a petition (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Steven Ultrino for legislation to expand the treatment of cleft palate and cleft lip.  Financial Services.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 17J of chapter 32A of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2022 Official Edition, is hereby amended by striking out, in line 4, the words “children under the age of 18” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- any individual. \r\n\tSECTION 2. Section 10G of chapter 118E of the General Laws, as so appearing, is hereby amended by striking out, in line 1, the words “For children under the age of 18, the division” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- The division. \r\n\tSECTION 3. Section 47BB of chapter 175 of the General Laws, as so appearing, is hereby amended by striking out, in lines 6 to 8, inclusive, the words “a child under the age of 18 shall cover the cost of treating cleft lip and cleft palate for the child” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- an individual shall cover the cost of treating cleft lip and cleft palate for the individual. \r\n\tSECTION 4. Section 8EE of chapter 176A of the General Laws, as so appearing, is hereby amended by striking out, in lines 7 to 9, inclusive, the words “a child under the age of 18 shall provide coverage for the cost of treating cleft lip and cleft palate for the child” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- an individual shall provide coverage for the cost of treating cleft lip and cleft palate for the individual.  \r\n\tSECTION 5. Section 4EE of chapter 176B of the General Laws, as so appearing, is hereby amended by striking out, in lines 31 and 32, the words “a child under the age of 18 shall provide coverage for the cost of treating cleft lip and cleft palate for the child” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- an individual shall provide coverage for the cost of treating cleft lip and cleft palate for the individual.  \r\n\tSECTION 6. Section 4W of chapter 176G of the General Laws, as so appearing, is hereby amended by striking out, in lines 2 to 4, inclusive, the words “a child under the age of 18 shall provide coverage for the cost of treating cleft lip and cleft palate for the child” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- an individual shall provide coverage for the cost of treating cleft lip and cleft palate for the individual. \r\n\tSECTION 7. Section 12 of chapter 176I of the General Laws, as so appearing, is hereby amended by striking out, in lines 2 and 3, the words “a child under the age of 18 shall provide coverage for the cost of treating cleft lip and cleft palate for the child” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- an individual shall provide coverage for the cost of treating cleft lip and cleft palate for the individual.  \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H33","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H33"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J11","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J11"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}